d honestly, I find it incredibly helpful. I genuinely believe it is one of the best channels for sharing Hindu mythology, especially for young children who are gradually becoming disconnected from their traditions and cultural roots while adopting Western influences.\n\nYour videos can help them learn about our mythology, understand our traditions and, most importantly, stay connected to our gods and cultural heritage.\n\nThank you, Rishi, for creating such informative and meaningful content. Keep up the amazing work! ❤️❤️. Happy deepavali to you bro", "timestamp": 1794074198, "like_count": 26}, {"author": "toofani_billautii", "author_id": "59665191190", "id": "18009391077005921", "text": "Diyas are done to be 5,7,11,21,51,101 right?", "timestamp": 1794068889, "like_count": 24}, {"author": "crimes.lenore", "author_id": "28153546953", "id": "18576401692074714", "text": "This is going to be so helpful for tomorrow ❤️", "timestamp": 1794068521, "like_count": 10}, {"author": "_ishallwin_", "author_id": "1376803452", "id": "18093547154227612", "text": "Very informative 🙏", "timestamp": 1794068313, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "therishikatha", "author_id": "22569163881", "id": "18116198408272826", "text": "Our order, as you face the chowki: Saraswati · Lakshmi · Ganesha 🪔 Many homes keep Ganesha on the left instead, and no scripture fixes one way.\nWhat's yours? Comment S-L-G, G-L-S, or your own! And whatever you missed, the closing prayer asks God to make it complete. 🙏", "timestamp": 1794068151, "like_count": 8}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfclb6lRFB_/", "webpage_url_basename": "Dfclb6lRFB_", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/882748287_18132764242755882_2912760257260113011_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyNTI1NjgxMzAxMTQyMzM1OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5